<title>USA: Home Properties in deal to buy 1,750 apts.</title>
<headline>Home Properties in deal to buy 1,750 apts.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Properties said it will buy 1,750 apartment units in 12 suburban Philadelphia communities for $63 million.</p>
<p>Home Properties is a self-managed real estate investment trust which owns and manages 32 communities with 8,446 apartment units (not including the pending portfolio acquisition) and one community containing 202 manufactured home sites.</p>
</text>
